<title>FINLAND: TT-Tieto Q1 profit rises 44.5 pct.</title>
<headline>TT-Tieto Q1 profit rises 44.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31 -</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax    60.4 vs 41.8</p>
<p> Net sales					  594.5 vs 465.6</p>
<p> Operating profit				  55.2 vs 37.6</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   4.24 vs 2.64</p>
<p>NOTE - Seven analysts' Q1 median forecast for Finnish data systems and services group TT-Tieto had been 56 million markka (range 44-61 million).</p>
</text>
